Per my voice mail, here is the latest draft of the purchase order (we are
preparing a redlined version which I will send you shortly). We have not had
the opportunity to incorporate all the business terms which were discussed
and agreed to yesterday. Also, we have not yet completed a full internal
review of the document. However, so that we can hold our conference call
today, I am sending you the draft. Please give me a call to arrange the
conference call.

Kara

